# Captured measurement evidence: preserve bytes exactly as recorded.
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion for this directory. Without it,
# a checkout on a machine with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite LF to CRLF
# in the working tree, changing every file's bytes and making the SHA-256
# values in SHA256SUMS.txt fail to verify. Diff and merge are left enabled
# so the evidence stays reviewable as text.
#
# Nothing here is source code; these files are raw artifacts of the
# 2026-09-09 measurement campaign and must not be normalised or reformatted
# (including their trailing whitespace, which is emitted verbatim by the
# capture scripts).
* -text
